{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Engineering Skills 工作流",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "requirement-path",
        "label": "需求收敛",
        "focus": [
          "start",
          "spec_check",
          "scope_check",
          "grilling",
          "wayfinding",
          "to_spec",
          "spec"
        ],
        "note": "先核对已确认契约，并分别判断不确定性、影响范围和验证难度，需求未定时使用 grilling，关键技术路径需跨会话调查时使用 wayfinding。"
      },
      {
        "id": "design-path",
        "label": "技术方案设计",
        "focus": [
          "scope_check",
          "spec",
          "contract_check",
          "to_spec",
          "high_level_design",
          "execution_check"
        ],
        "note": "单一范围也可能需要 SOLUTION，方案设计检查独立于执行图判断，需要 SOLUTION 而缺少 SPEC 时先由 to-spec 固化已确认需求。"
      },
      {
        "id": "delivery-path",
        "label": "执行交付",
        "focus": [
          "execution_check",
          "quick_implement",
          "to_tickets",
          "loop",
          "ticket_implement",
          "verify",
          "delivery"
        ],
        "note": "无图的单一范围用 quick-implement。有图时 graph-workflow 派发 ticket-implement，verify 把结论交回 graph-workflow 再派发修正；最终交付还需 simplify、verify、code-review 收尾。"
      }
    ],
    "output": "engineering-workflow.html"
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "req",
      "label": "需求与设计"
    },
    {
      "id": "exec",
      "label": "执行与交付"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "to_tickets",
    "loop",
    "ticket_implement",
    "verify"
  ],
